## Cross-Episode Improvement Targets

Track these metrics across episodes:

| Metric | How to Improve |
|--------|---------------|
| Time to first working output | Extract patterns, reduce re-discovery |
| Test pass rate | Learn from specific failure modes |
| Format correctness | Template the output structure |
| Environment familiarity | Note tool availability, paths, quirks |

